The model contains 500353 pretrained 256-dimensional float32 token vectors.
It was distilled/trained from BAAI/bge-m3 with multilingual Tokenlearn data.
DFCN performs local Unigram segmentation using the packaged normalization map,
mean pooling and L2 normalization, followed by cosine-distance retrieval.
There is no remote inference, API key, character-hash embedding, or model training
at game runtime. The original matrix is mapped read-only once per core.

